@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, schema
+    :tickets: 5276
+
+    Fixed issue where ``dialect_options`` were omitted when a
+    database object (e.g., :class:`.Table`) was copied using
+    :func:`.tometadata`.
\ No newline at end of file
